      "value": "There's currently no way to set different numbers ingame as of this moment, but you can change this number using the [configuration file](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/configuration-file) \nYou can read more specifics on how to change this in the documentation for the [dynamic bone limiter](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/avatar-dynamic-bone-limits#modifying-the-dynamic-bone-limits)",
