      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{59a50e29df83a3566e6fb959|full_name}: Thanks for the info. Didn't know there was a config for it. Again, thank you.\nBut my point still stands. Making this (and maybe even other things) more accessible or accessible ingame in the first place will be not only convenient but also helping out everybody that doesn't wanna do things in the config files. There are a few that don't wanna do sth. in a text editor, I believe.",
