  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-30T18:49:56.984Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As we all know, dynamic bones  can affect performance drastically.\nAs of now there only is the option to limit DynamicBones to an amount set by the devs.\nPersonally, I think giving multiple options here could improve the experience.\nI just wanna have more control over DynamicBones as it is either see next to no DynamicBones or see all of them.",
